<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Visuals</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg-1: #0b1020;
        --bg-2: #121a2b;
        --panel: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);
        --panel-strong: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.92);
        --line: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
        --text: #e5eefb;
        --muted: #8ea3c7;
        --accent: #7c3aed;
        --accent-2: #22d3ee;
        --accent-3: #f59e0b;
        --success: #34d399;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; }

      html, body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100%;
        font-family: Inter, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.28), transparent 20%),
          radial-gradient(circle at 80% 10%, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.22), transparent 18%),
          linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-1), var(--bg-2));
        color: var(--text);
      }

      body {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding: 32px;
      }

      .scene {
        position: relative;
        width: min(1100px, 100%);
        min-height: 760px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: rgba(9, 13, 22, 0.72);
        backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
        border-radius: 30px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
      }

      .orb {
        position: absolute;
        border-radius: 50%;
        filter: blur(10px);
        opacity: 0.8;
        animation: float 12s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
      }

      .orb.one {
        width: 260px;
        height: 260px;
        right: 8%;
        top: 6%;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.85), rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.45), transparent 70%);
      }

      .orb.two {
        width: 240px;
        height: 240px;
        left: 6%;
        bottom: 12%;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.75), rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2), transparent 72%);
        animation-delay: 1.5s;
      }

      @keyframes float {
        0% { transform: translateY(0px) scale(1); }
        100% { transform: translateY(-24px) scale(1.08); }
      }

      .grid {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background-image:
          linear-gradient(rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.06) 1px, transparent 1px),
          linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.06) 1px, transparent 1px);
        background-size: 42px 42px;
        mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black 50%, transparent 100%);
      }

      .content {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
        min-height: 760px;
      }

      .left {
        padding: 54px 52px 42px 52px;
      }

      .topbar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        margin-bottom: 58px;
      }

      .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #f8fbff;
      }

      .brand-mark {
        width: 12px;
        height: 12px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
        box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.75);
      }

      nav {
        display: flex;
        gap: 28px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      nav a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: inherit;
      }

      .cta {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 12px 18px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.55);
        color: var(--text);
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5.2rem);
        line-height: 0.94;
        letter-spacing: -0.06em;
      }

      .highlight {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff, #9bdcff 30%, #d2a8ff 70%, #ffd3a3);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
      }

      .lead {
        max-width: 620px;
        margin-top: 22px;
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 18px;
        margin-top: 32px;
      }

      .button-primary,
      .button-secondary {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 16px 24px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
      }

      .button-primary {
        color: #0c1220;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dff6ff, #9ae6ff 35%, #c4b5fd 100%);
        box-shadow: 0 18px 36px rgba(107, 138, 255, 0.35);
      }

      .button-secondary {
        color: var(--text);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      }

      .button-primary:hover,
      .button-secondary:hover,
      .cta:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }

      .stats {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(120px, 1fr));
        gap: 18px;
        margin-top: 44px;
        max-width: 620px;
      }

      .stat {
        padding: 18px 18px 14px;
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.52);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .stat strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.06em;
      }

      .stat span {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .right {
        position: relative;
        padding: 52px 36px 32px 36px;
      }

      .panel {
        position: relative;
        height: 100%;
        border-radius: 28px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9));
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .panel::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3), transparent 35%);
      }

      .mockup {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 28px 24px 24px 24px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      .window-bar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.06);
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.14);
      }

      .dots {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .dots span {
        width: 10px;
        height: 10px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: block;
      }

      .dots span:nth-child(1) { background: #fb7185; }
      .dots span:nth-child(2) { background: #fbbf24; }
      .dots span:nth-child(3) { background: #34d399; }

      .chart-box {
        flex: 1;
        margin-top: 22px;
        padding: 16px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        background: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.28);
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12);
      }

      .chart {
        height: 220px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: end;
        gap: 16px;
        padding: 20px 12px 0;
      }

      .bar {
        flex: 1;
        border-radius: 14px 14px 0 0;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.95), rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.85));
        box-shadow: 0 14px 28px rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.25);
        position: relative;
      }

      .bar:nth-child(1) { height: 35%; }
      .bar:nth-child(2) { height: 54%; }
      .bar:nth-child(3) { height: 68%; }
      .bar:nth-child(4) { height: 50%; }
      .bar:nth-child(5) { height: 82%; }
      .bar:nth-child(6) { height: 96%; }
      .bar:nth-child(7) { height: 88%; }
      .bar:nth-child(8) { height: 72%; }

      .mini-card {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 14px;
        padding: 16px 18px;
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.72);
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.14);
      }

      .mini-card .pills {
        display: flex;
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .pill {
        width: 26px;
        height: 26px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-2), var(--accent));
      }

      .pill.alt {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-3), #fb7185);
      }

      .badge {
        padding: 8px 10px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.12);
        border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);
        color: #9ef0c6;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .content {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .left {
          padding-bottom: 0;
        }

        .right {
          padding-top: 0;
          padding-bottom: 40px;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 620px) {
        body { padding: 18px; }

        .scene { min-height: auto; }

        .left { padding: 28px 20px 18px; }
        .topbar { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 18px; }
        nav { gap: 14px; font-size: 0.78rem; }

        .actions { flex-direction: column; }
        .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .right { padding: 0 18px 22px; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="scene">
      <div class="orb one"></div>
      <div class="orb two"></div>
      <div class="grid"></div>

      <div class="content">
        <section class="left">
          <header class="topbar">
            <div class="brand">
              <span class="brand-mark"></span>
              <span>Nova</span>
            </div>

            <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
              <a href="#">Overview</a>
              <a href="#">Studio</a>
              <a href="#">Pricing</a>
              <a href="#">Contact</a>
            </nav>

            <button class="cta">Launch</button>
          </header>

          <h1>
            Design<br />
            <span class="highlight">visuals</span><br />
            that stand out.
          </h1>

          <p class="lead">
            We craft immersive brand experiences, motion-rich interfaces, and bold visual systems that turn ideas into memorable digital stories.
          </p>

          <div class="actions">
            <a class="button-primary" href="#">Start Project</a>
            <a class="button-secondary" href="#">View Work</a>
          </div>

          <div class="stats">
            <div class="stat">
              <strong>120+</strong>
              <span>brands launched</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <strong>4.9/5</strong>
              <span>client rating</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <strong>24k</strong>
              <span>design systems</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <aside class="right">
          <div class="panel">
            <div class="mockup">
              <div class="window-bar">
                <div class="dots">
                  <span></span>
                  <span></span>
                  <span></span>
                </div>
                <span class="badge">Live</span>
              </div>

              <div class="chart-box">
                <div class="chart" aria-label="bar chart">
                  <span class="bar"></span>
                  <span class="bar"></span>
                  <span class="bar"></span>
                  <span class="bar"></span>
                  <span class="bar"></span>
                  <span class="bar"></span>
                  <span class="bar"></span>
                  <span class="bar"></span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="mini-card">
                <div class="pills">
                  <span class="pill"></span>
                  <span class="pill alt"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="badge">+38.2%</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
